  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "Acer shirasawanum 'Purple Thunder' Red Japanese Maple Zones 5-9 'Purple Thunder' is a newer selection of shirasawanum hybrid that was selected by Talon Buchholz for its dark foliage that cup downward. 'Purple Thunder' turns to a bright fiery red in the fall. 'Purple Thunder' is new, but we expect 'Purple Thunder' to reach 12-15 ft in height in 10 years. Photos are by Talon Buchholz and are used with permission."
